| X-17 | `flutter analyze` PASS（0 issues）· `flutter test` PASS · `flutter build apk --debug` PASS | 完整输出 |
| X-18 | **Android 模拟器/真机运行验证**：L1 与 L2′ PASS；L2/L3 按授权执行或写明 NOT EXECUTED | §9.5 证据包 |
